<title>SINGAPORE: CityDev 1H net profit up 33.7 pct.</title>
<headline>CityDev 1H net profit up 33.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30 1996</p>
<p>	     (in million of Singapore $ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			  209.72  vs  156.83</p>
